{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":36.20000076293945,"text":"All right, when we got into the steel roof, we had some tree damage earlier that landed on the steel roof and messed up three of the panels. So I started to take those panels off as I took the panels off and found that the edge of the roof had been leaking for quite a long time. In fact, I couldn't even repair what had been damaged because the raptor tails had rotted right off. And what did you do there? We added new raptor tails, cut the sheeting back two foot, added that. It's going to get ice water shielded across to keep that ice dam from pushing up in and rotting the roof again, and it's getting new steel on top.","segments":[{"id":0,"seek":0,"start":0.7400000095367432,"end":6.119999885559082,"text":" All right, when we got into the steel roof, we had some tree damage earlier that landed","tokens":[50364,1057,558,11,562,321,658,666,264,8269,8418,11,321,632,512,4230,4344,3071,300,15336,50670],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.40798452496528625,"compression_ratio":1.7638376951217651,"no_speech_prob":0.6510014533996582},{"id":1,"seek":0,"start":6.119999885559082,"end":9.140000343322754,"text":" on the steel roof and messed up three of the panels.","tokens":[50670,322,264,8269,8418,293,16507,493,1045,295,264,13419,13,50856],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.40798452496528625,"compression_ratio":1.7638376951217651,"no_speech_prob":0.6510014533996582},{"id":2,"seek":0,"start":9.779999732971191,"end":13.5600004196167,"text":" So I started to take those panels off as I took the panels off and found that the edge","tokens":[50856,407,286,1409,281,747,729,13419,766,382,286,1890,264,13419,766,293,1352,300,264,4691,51036],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.40798452496528625,"compression_ratio":1.7638376951217651,"no_speech_prob":0.6510014533996582},{"id":3,"seek":0,"start":13.5600004196167,"end":15.579999923706055,"text":" of the roof had been leaking for quite a long time.","tokens":[51036,29